    {
      "source": "The store can be persisted to and restored from a JSON file via the\n<a href=\"#save(java.io.File)\"><code>save(java.io.File)</code></a> and <a href=\"#load(java.io.File)\"><code>load(java.io.File)</code></a> /\n<a href=\"#load(org.springframework.core.io.Resource)\"><code>load(org.springframework.core.io.Resource)</code></a> methods.",
      "translation": "该商店可以通过 `<a href=\"#save(java.io.File)\"><code>save(java.io.File)</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"#load(java.io.File)\"><code>load(java.io.File)</code></a>` / `<a href=\"#load(org.springframework.core.io.Resource)\"><code>load(org.springframework.core.io.Resource)</code></a>` 方法持久化到 JSON 文件并从其中恢复。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Uses a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ConcurrentHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ConcurrentHashMap</code></a> to store vectors and their\nassociated metadata. Map keys are document IDs; values are\n<code>SimpleVectorStoreContent</code> instances that encapsulate each document's text,\nmetadata, and embedding vector.",
      "translation": "使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ConcurrentHashMap.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ConcurrentHashMap</code></a> 来存储向量及其相关元数据。映射的键为文档 ID；值为 <code>SimpleVectorStoreContent</code> 实例，这些实例封装了每个文档的文本、元数据和嵌入向量。",
      "count": 1
    },
